<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES- One tender of A$15.0 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES- One tender of A$15.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market has started the week lacking its recent vigor, with MLC Building Society's A$15 million issue the only promissory note tender on Monday.</p>
<p>The February 12-dated paper sold in line with the corresponding BBSW mid-rate.</p>
<p>Market torpor also has extended to the physical bill curve which sits lower than Friday morning's levels despite dealers reporting buying interest out to ninety days.</p>
<p>At 0020 GMT (11.20 a.m.) March bill futures were unchanged at 94.29.</p>
